# Chekov and McCoy: the trigger is only for counters *you* put on *him*. Bot2's Voldaren Thrillseeker enters with backup 2 and puts its
# two +1/+1 counters on Bot1's Chekov: Bot1 is never offered a draw (his hand grows only by his own draw step), and Chekov is 5/5 all the
# same, so the counters really were put on him.

